DESCRIPTION:Jilberto's dad skipped his wedding\, his brother just had a bab
 y and everyone keeps asking when he's having kids. He's not. But he'll deli
 ver an hour of comedy about it: which honestly seems healthier. ¡Ay! Papi 
 is a stand-up hour about fatherhood from someone who isn't one. As a gay\, 
 first-generation Mexican American\, Jilberto Soto examines the daddies who 
 disappeared\, the fathers that tried and the quiet pressure on men to step 
 into the role... eventually. Big questions. Small family. One gay son with 
 a lot to say.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/ay-pap
 i-jilberto-soto/
